WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.867
To upload John Deere's order file, go to Orders, and pick DTP or GMBH at the top.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:07.516
Not All.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:10.021
Click Actions, then Upload file.

00:00:11.441 --> 00:00:16.096
Click Choose file, and pick the Excel file you downloaded from John Deere.

00:00:16.096 --> 00:00:17.984
Then click Upload and compare.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:23.358
When it is done, the app shows what changed since the last file, and emails the team.
